# Golden-PR annotations are the answer key. Holdout-window annotations must
# stay out of the public repo (contamination policy; see
# benchmarks/golden/README.md). Ignored by default; a dev-set window's
# annotations are force-added when it is deliberately published.
benchmarks/golden/annotated/*
!benchmarks/golden/annotated/.gitkeep
